(
    title: "River Raid",
    developer: Some("Carol Shaw"),
    description: Some("The player flies a jet down an endlessly scrolling river canyon, steering left and right and varying speed while shooting tankers, helicopters, bridges and fuel depots. Fuel drains constantly and is topped up by flying over a depot, so depots must be crossed rather than destroyed. Destroying the bridge that ends a section makes it the restart point after a life is lost."),
